'''agrief†''' (a-grēf′), ''prep. phr.'' as ''adv.'' [ME. also ''agreef, agref, agreve''; < ''a''<sup>3</sup> + ''grief''.] '''1.''' In grief. ''Chaucer.'' —'''2.''' Amiss;
